Consume a soul whole to rebuild your body, healing you for [301, 398, 473, 537, 594 (TL1-5; SP 100)] and generating [118, 155, 185, 209, 231 (TL1-5; SP 100)] mana.

If used below 1 life the surge increases your spellpower by [15, 26, 35, 43, 50 (TL1-5)] for 10 turns.

The heal and mana increases with your Spellpower.
